      "devanagari": "एष ज्ञाति सहस्रेण स्थपतिः परिवारितः |\nकुशलो दण्डक अरण्ये वृद्धो भ्रातुः च ते सखा",
      "iast": "eṣa GYāti sahasreṇa sthapatiḥ parivāritaḥ |\nkuśalo daṇḍaka araṇye vṛddho bhrātuḥ ca te sakhā",
      "translation": "\"This Lord who is surrounded by a thousand of his own people, is fully acquainted with the forest of Dandaka and also an old friend of your elder brother.\"",
